{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>想要簡化每日規劃、快速掌握行程的讀者，Slim Calendar 以輕量日曆結合清晰檢視、事件管理與主畫面小工具，讓日程安排更直觀。此應用原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合需要簡潔日曆工具的使用者把握機會下載。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-228.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>清晰日曆與行程管理</h2>\n<p>Slim Calendar 是輕巧日曆應用，主打清晰檢視與直覺事件管理。用戶可在今日、每週及每月檢視間切換，快速掌握行程；完成任務或事件後可標記為已完成，方便追蹤進度。主畫面提供 Today、Week、Month 多種尺寸小工具，無須開啟應用即可查看安排；收到提醒時亦可直接於通知中標記完成，減少操作步驟。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-222-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-223-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-224-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-225-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-226-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Slim Calendar</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/slim-calendar/id6825167346?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T19:36:11.583569+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T19:19:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T20:18:04.462473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T19:29:35.888927+00:00","content_hash":"169dff7fb3ea6852a7b48c0797847fd1a4c62f1d8408118cded972c064f18b8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}